# batch-4 (review round-2 fix) — gate evidence

Reviewer round 2, item 1 flagged the bare multi-name except at
`src/debrief/adapters/ggufbench_store.py:126`. Fix applied to that file and to
`src/debrief/adapters/buildwright_log.py` (the second file the formatter gate
flags): module constant `_MISSING_PATH_ERRORS = (FileNotFoundError, NotADirectoryError)`
caught as `except _MISSING_PATH_ERRORS:`. Rationale and evidence: see
`harness/progress/impl_debrief_bench_query.md`, Dispatch 4.

All commands below were run in this session via the harness run gate; outputs quoted
verbatim. Re-run with the same commands to reproduce.

